    "detailed_description": "Enjoy the most famous paintings from Finland in Virtual Reality! The Art Gallery is placed on a space station, which additionally for the basic gallery, includes a warehouse and an extra gallery for Mr. Hugo Simberg's paintings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere is the list of painters in an alphaphetical order:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAhlstedt, Fredrik<br />\r\nChurberg, Fanny<br />\r\nEdelfelt, Albert<br />\r\nGallen-Kallela, Akseli<br />\r\nJ\u00e4rnefelt, Eero<br />\r\nSchjerfbeck, Helene<br />\r\nSimberg, Hugo<br />\r\nWright, Ferdinand von<br />\r\nWright, Magnus von",
